meta {
  name: Download TACOTS recommendation
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/tacots/download/tacotsrecommendation
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download TACOTS Recommendations (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `tacots_recommendation` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts them to CSV using `json2csv` in the controller layer. The response is sent directly as a `text/csv` attachment — this endpoint does **not** return JSON.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="tacots_recommendation.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per recommendation record with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `firstName` | Student's first name |
  | `middleName` | Student's middle name |
  | `surname` | Student's surname |
  | `gender` | Student's gender |
  | `age` | Student's age |
  | `dob` | Date of birth |
  | `religion` | Student's religion |
  | `catholicSacraments` | Catholic sacraments received |
  | `parishAttended` | Parish attended |
  | `diocese` | Diocese |
  | `primaryLanguage` | Primary language spoken |
  | `phoneNumber` | Student's phone number |
  | `nationality` | Student's nationality |
  | `stateOfOrigin` | State of origin |
  | `lga` | Local government area |
  | `homeAddress` | Home address |
  | `schoolName` | Name of last school attended |
  | `schoolTown` | Town where the school is located |
  | `schoolState` | State where the school is located |
  | `lastYearAttended` | Last year attended in school |
  | `lastClass` | Last class/grade completed |
  | `classPositionLastTerm` | Position in class last term |
  | `lastTermAverage` | Average score from last term |
  | `passportPhotoUrl` | Cloudinary URL for passport photo |
  | `passportPhotoPublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for passport photo |
  | `lastResultUrl` | Cloudinary URL for last result document |
  | `lastResultPublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for last result |
  | `fathersName` | Father's full name |
  | `fathersOccupation` | Father's occupation |
  | `fathersPhone` | Father's phone number |
  | `mothersName` | Mother's full name |
  | `mothersOccupation` | Mother's occupation |
  | `mothersPhone` | Mother's phone number |
  | `parentsAddress` | Parents' home address |
  | `guardianName` | Guardian's full name |
  | `guardianPhone` | Guardian's phone number |
  | `guardianRelationship` | Guardian's relationship to student |
  | `guardianOccupation` | Guardian's occupation |
  | `guardianAddress` | Guardian's address |
  | `householdSize` | Number of people in household |
  | `numSiblings` | Number of siblings |
  | `familyPosition` | Student's position in the family |
  | `specialCircumstances` | Any special circumstances |
  | `annualHouseholdIncome` | Annual household income |
  | `incomeSources` | Sources of household income |
  | `numIncomeEarners` | Number of income earners in household |
  | `avgMonthlyIncome` | Average monthly income |
  | `livesWith` | Who the student lives with |
  | `residenceType` | Type of residence |
  | `hasElectricity` | Whether the residence has electricity |
  | `recommenderFirstName` | Recommender's first name |
  | `recommenderLastName` | Recommender's last name |
  | `recommenderPhone` | Recommender's phone number |
  | `recommenderAddress` | Recommender's address |
  | `childBackgroundNotes` | Background notes about the child |
  | `supportTypesNeeded` | Types of support needed |
  | `otherImportantInfo` | Other important information |
  | `disciplineRating` | Discipline rating |
  | `responsibilityRating` | Responsibility rating |
  | `careerGoal` | Student's career goal |
  | `studentStatement` | Student's personal statement |
  | `declarationConfirmed` | Whether the declaration was confirmed |
  | `adminStatus` | Admin status (`PENDING`, `SELECTED`, `NOT SELECTED`) |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
